## Backups

Database backups use [django-dbbackup](https://django-dbbackup.readthedocs.io/):

```bash
make backup    # dump the database
make restore   # restore the latest dump (never against production)
```

Without Celery, schedule a nightly dump with cron:

```bash
0 2 * * * cd /path/to/{{ project_name }} && uv run manage.py dbbackup
```

Test the restore drill into a scratch database before you need it.
